Prepare for the coming.

2
00:10:54,000 --> 00:11:00,000
Lord of Illusions is a horror, fantasy, drama film directed by Clive Barker.

3
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:27,000
During a routine case in L.A., NY private investigator Harry D'Amour stumbles over members of a fanatic cult who are
preparing for the resurrection of their leader Nix, a powerful magician who was killed 13 years earlier.

4
00:21:48,000 --> 00:21:54,000
Harry D'Amour, played by Scott Bakula.

5
00:27:15,000 --> 00:27:21,000
Philip Swann, played by Kevin J. O'Connor.

6
